sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Panel UI
  participant P as Panel
  participant DNS as DNS provider
  participant A as Edge agent
  participant CA as ACME CA

  UI->>P: create site<br/>(source, domain, server)
  P->>P: find zone<br/>(longest suffix match)
  P->>DNS: create A / AAAA<br/>(+ www CNAME)
  P->>P: wait for propagation<br/>(public resolvers + authoritative NS)
  P->>A: site.deploy (build in job<br/>container, atomic release switch)
  A-->>P: release active
  P->>A: acme.challenge.put
  P->>CA: order certificate (HTTP-01)
  CA->>A: GET /.well-known/<br/>acme-challenge/…
  CA-->>P: certificate
  P->>A: cert.install + edge.apply
  P->>A: availability check
  P-->>UI: done, https://domain
